{"id": "DedYH1nD8SJ", "title": "Video by anchorlinedigital", "description": "One Chinese chip just knocked billions off Korea's biggest companies in a day.\n\nReports say China's CXMT has found a way to pack more memory into each chip. On Oct 13, Korea's Kospi closed down 5.5% and SK hynix and Samsung sank. Micron had already closed under $1,000 the day before.\n\nThe twist: nobody thinks memory demand is shrinking. Bank of America still forecasts a $2 trillion memory market by 2030. Investors weren't afraid of less money. They were afraid of sharing it.\n\nComment \"GUIDE\" to learn how to make videos like this 👇\n\nSources: Bloomberg, AFP, CNBC, Mint, Benzinga/BofA. Not financial advice.\n\n#stockmarket #semiconductors #investing #businessnews", "channel": "anchorlinedigital", "uploader_id": "25349745254", "uploader": "Anchorline", "timestamp": 1791947161, "like_count": 16, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18122218090841255a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 69.894, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPXMnH0R-t3NVtSzUW6heoiMscBUeUw9iSvPdmyWQNtX9_-0h44KsRE2jfEvLJErlEI2X8V3GltF8qtIkExOUf82upsb-RrXU3l8Qw.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=zLpFipXZup4Q7kNvwEf-RAB&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Z770NYDeNX00-KztRAXMAQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&_nc_enc=UtSRf1b0z1XSokDg6rCR3Ebv_5DiENE6kMKgErXseF0EUpNtSvzxF9X-hCc1ZgRaXocKLJ_Tcpaj38idJfM7stI5a_g7ObYqDBN4FJivSHSvbFYwk4MOHCYpnlU&oh=00_AQSLA5zF_luA8uVDsgy1DJbqRNArUeeBVzZJUfTga8fmJQ&oe=6AF3FED9", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "i